# Application pepper for password hashing (base64-encoded)
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
PO_APP_PEPPER=replace-with-base64-encoded-32-byte-random-value
# Instruct dioxus-cli not to download other tools such as esbuild, set this to 1
# NO_DOWNLOADS=1

# --- iOS physical-device deploy (scripts/ios-device-deploy.sh) ---
# All values are auto-detected; uncomment only to override.
# DEVICE=<CoreDevice UUID from `xcrun devicectl list devices`>
# UDID=<device UDID from `xtool devices --usb --no-wait`>
# (the plain `xtool devices` form exits 1 on a stale Wi-Fi entry — its `--all`
# mode aborts at the first one — while `--usb --no-wait` prints the attached
# device and exits 0. The harness itself probes per transport and is unaffected.)
# DEVSERVER_IP=192.168.1.100
# DEVSERVER_PORT=8080